  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 8.1\tThe proposed single storey rear wraparound by reason of its depth and height would harm neighbouring amenities by reason of loss of outlook and increased sense of enclosure to neighbour at 40 Staveley Road. The insertion of side windows would further add to the harm and result on loss of privacy for neighbours, contrary to policies CC1, CC2 and SC7 of the Local Plan and Sections 1.0 and 4.0 of the REGs.\r\n\r\n8.2\tThe proposed two storey side extension and the creation of a single storey rear wraparound extension would undermine the prominence of the main building resulting on a bulky addition that would undermine the original footprint of the property and the appearance of the rear elevation, contrary to the provision of policies CC1, CC2, CC4 and SC7 of the Local Plan and Sections 1.0, 4.0 and 8.0 of the REGs.\r\n"
